  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-144-zhaozhou-brothers:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">和皇帝中興元年（辛巳，公元五零一年）</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-144-zhaozhou-brothers:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zizhitongjian-144-zhaozhou-brothers:p002:m0000" ref="tvq_7my_nqh">崔慧景</persName>之敗也，巴陵王<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-144-zhaozhou-brothers:p002:m0010" ref="x3q_cqm_dup_A">昭冑</persName>、永新侯<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-144-zhaozhou-brothers:p002:m0016" ref="x3q_cqm_dup_B">昭穎</persName>出投台軍</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-144-zhaozhou-brothers:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zizhitongjian-144-zhaozhou-brothers:p003:m0000" ref="iqm_xms_alz">寅</persName>遣人殺<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-144-zhaozhou-brothers:p003:m0004" ref="nfw_sg5_7qx">山沙</persName>於路，吏於麝A134得其事。<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-144-zhaozhou-brothers:p003:m0020" ref="x3q_cqm_dup_A">昭冑</persName>兄弟與<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-144-zhaozhou-brothers:p003:m0025" ref="jle_qnt_6yr">偃</persName>等皆伏誅。</p>
